OL,3,GNEWSAPart of A52 work pushed back after
OL,4,Apetition
OL,5,
OL,6,FPart of a scheme to upgrade the A52 in
OL,7,FNottinghamshire has been put back after
OL,8,Fa petition called for an urgent review
OL,9,Fto address "traffic gridlock".
OL,11,FWork to remove utility and telecoms
OL,12,Finfrastructure at Wheatcroft Island
OL,13,Fbegan in September ahead of a major
OL,14,Fredesign by National Highways,
OL,15,Fprompting complaints about prolonged
OL,16,Flane closures and severe congestion.
OL,18,FThe petition, by councillor Hetvi
OL,19,FParekh from Rushcliffe Borough Council,
OL,20,Fsaid the work was causing "significant
OL,21,Fdisruption, adding the "impact on every
OL,22,Fday life is considerable".
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
