OL,3,GNEWSAPart of A52 work pushed back after
OL,4,Apetition
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe preliminary works were due to move
OL,7,Fto the Nottingham Knight junction this
OL,8,Fmonth but have now been deferred until
OL,9,Fmid-January.
